# Prettier scope for `cargo xtask fmt` (xtask/src/main.rs `fmt`).
#
# Byte-exact reference vectors. Prettier rewrites these JSON files, which
# breaks the byte-for-byte golden comparisons (tests/fixtures/golden/**,
# tests/fixtures/spatial/query_vectors.json).
tests/fixtures/

# Hand-maintained prose, wrapped at a fixed width. Prettier's markdown
# formatter rewrites list continuation indentation across the whole docs tree
# and work-plan.md (observed: CHANGELOG.md lost the continuation indent of
# every wrapped bullet), so the markdown tree is excluded deliberately.
*.md

# Separate pnpm project with its own toolchain (apps/studio/package.json);
# the root prettier invocation has no config for it.
apps/studio/
